WIZYBOO ZIP SYSTEM SERVICES
==========================
Service ID: wzip
Module: WizyBoo ZIP System
Version: 0.1-placeholder
Status: SPECIFICATION - implementation required

PURPOSE
Define archive-management features for WizyBoo project files and module packages.

PLANNED FUNCTIONS
- Create ZIP archives from selected project files and folders.
- Extract ZIP archives into a selected destination.
- Organize WizyBoo project folders.
- Verify archive integrity before extraction.
- Create and manage project backup archives.
- Package WizyBoo modules for distribution.

SAFETY REQUIREMENTS
- Show the archive contents before extraction.
- Reject unsafe paths that attempt to write outside the selected destination.
- Do not overwrite existing files without clear user confirmation.
- Treat files inside archives as untrusted.
- Never execute files automatically after extraction.

PLANNED REQUEST FIELDS
action=<create|extract|list|verify|backup>
source=<selected-file-or-folder>
destination=<selected-destination>
archive=<archive-path>

PLANNED RESPONSE FIELDS
status=<ok|error|not_implemented>
message=<human-readable-result>
archive=<created-or-checked-archive-path>

IMPORTANT
This is a text-based service specification placeholder.
It does not yet contain executable ZIP-handling code or perform archive operations.
